[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0632","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0632.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0548","title":"MIT Kerberos 4 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Kerberos 4 密钥分发中心（KDC）程序的 kerb_err_reply 函数中存在基于 e_msg 变量的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-120）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 Kerberos 服务发送特制网络数据包触发该溢出，导致 KDC 服务崩溃或不可用，进而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 MIT Kerberos 4 全系列（含 4.0 及 patch10）、MIT Kerberos 5 1.0 至 1.1.1 版本以及 Cygnus Network Security/KerbNet 产品。攻击者无需任何凭据即可在网络可达的情况下利用此漏洞，攻击复杂度低，仅造成可用性部分损失，不涉及数据泄露或篡改。CERT 发布了 CA-2000-11 安全公告，RedHat 同步发布了 RHSA-2000-031 修复补丁，MIT Kerberos 团队也发布了 krb4kdc.txt 公告和补丁程序，受影响用户应升级至安全版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0548"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58.423","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 krb5-1.2 正式版或更高版本，该版本已包含修复补丁；若仍在使用 krb5-1.0.x 或 krb5-1.1.x，须从 MIT 官方安全公告页面（web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/index.html）下载对应的 krb4kdc 补丁并应用至源码 kdc/kerberos_v4.c，补丁核心是将 kerb_err_reply 函数中的 strcat 替换为 strncat 并限制长度，同时在 APPL 请求处理中增加 MAX_KTXT_LEN 边界检查。若使用 MIT Kerberos 4，需应用 Patch 10 之后的安全补丁。若使用 KTH-krb4，须升级至 0.10 或更高版本。若暂时无法升级，可在 KDC 配置中禁用 Kerberos 4 兼容模式（设置 kdc_v4 = KDC_V4_DISABLE），或在防火墙层面仅允许受信客户端访问 KDC 端口 88，以限制攻击面。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2000:031 安全通告中的更新包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0064.html","http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/k-051.shtml","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/krb4kdc.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-11.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4875","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-031.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0548.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0548","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0548.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0548.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gpr4-gfq8-c66q/GHSA-gpr4-gfq8-c66q.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0548.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88334/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d29f330a-3c94-4fa9-8da6-9f1cc47c1829.json","https://github.com/rootio-avr/public-patches-catalog/blob/deba79f5cae79520d0503803e2f89c040f0fac71/alpine/3.18/krb5/amd64/APKBUILD"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0632.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0630","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0630.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0547","title":"MIT Kerberos 4 KDC 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Kerberos 4 KDC (密钥分发中心) 程序的 process_v4 函数中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 localrealm 变量参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致 KDC 服务崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 Kerberos 4 KDC 服务的系统，远程未授权攻击者可通过网络发送恶意构造的 Kerberos 请求数据包触发漏洞，无需身份认证即可导致 KDC 服务拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 5.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P)，属于中危拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者只需向目标 KDC 发送包含超长 localrealm 字段的恶意 Kerberos v4 请求即可触发缓冲区溢出导致服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务攻击。MIT Kerberos 团队已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级到修复版本或禁用 Kerberos 4 服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0547"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58.287","remediation":"立即升级至 Kerberos 5（krb5-1.1.1 或更高版本）或应用厂商提供的 Kerberos 4 补丁包（如 Red Hat RHSA-2000:047、Debian DSA-066）。若无法升级，请在防火墙层面封禁 KDC 端口（TCP/UDP 88、TCP 749）并禁用 Kerberos 4 KDC 服务（krb5kdc -4），同时在网络边界部署入侵检测规则拦截异常长度的 localrealm 参数请求。如需临时缓解，可在防火墙层面限制仅受信任网段访问 KDC 端口，并监控异常大包流量。升级后务必重启 KDC 服务并验证 kerberos 认证功能正常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0064.html","http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/k-051.shtml","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/krb4kdc.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-11.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1338","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0547.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0547","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0547.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0547.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x78p-3cmg-8mqw/GHSA-x78p-3cmg-8mqw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0547.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/rootio-avr/public-patches-catalog/blob/deba79f5cae79520d0503803e2f89c040f0fac71/alpine/3.18/krb5/amd64/APKBUILD","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--df4dbdd3-6360-4d63-871b-fa05bb2558a3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0630.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0629","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0629.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0546","title":"MIT Kerberos 4/5 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos 4.0/5.1.0/5.1.1 系统中存在 set_tgtkey 函数的缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向 Kerberos 密钥分发中心 (KDC) 发送特制的 IPv6 数据包，利用未初始化的 lastrealm 变量触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 Linux 系统中运行的 MIT Kerberos 认证服务，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0。漏洞源于复制时未检查输入长度，攻击者可通过构造超过缓冲区大小的数据包篡改内存，破坏认证服务并可能执行任意代码。此类攻击可导致 Kerberos 密钥分发中心崩溃、认证服务中断或被攻击者完全控制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0546"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58.157","remediation":"tags.<value>请立即升级到 MIT Kerberos 5.3.0 或更高版本，这是最完整的修复方案。如需使用旧版可行，至少要应用 2003 年发布的 krb5-1.3.4 或 2009 年发布的 krb5-1.6 安全补丁，并修改 krb.conf 文件中将 max_life 设为 10h，short_circuit 不使用 TGT 解析服务，这可以避免利用 lastrealm 变量的拒绝服务问题","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0064.html","http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/k-051.shtml","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/krb4kdc.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-11.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1338","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0546.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0546","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0546.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0546.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2wm7-6r5c-mjpc/GHSA-2wm7-6r5c-mjpc.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0546.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/rootio-avr/public-patches-catalog/blob/deba79f5cae79520d0503803e2f89c040f0fac71/alpine/3.18/krb5/amd64/APKBUILD","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--58bb8bac-ab30-47db-87fc-67338a81bfc9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0629.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0438","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0438.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0527","title":"3R Soft MailStudio 2000 2.0 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"MailStudio 2000 是 3R Soft 开发的基于 Web 的邮件管理软件，其 2.0 及更早版本中的 userreg.cgi CGI 脚本同时存在命令注入和栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可利用该漏洞以 root 身份在目标系统上执行任意命令或代码。一方面，攻击者可通过在 CGI 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如 %0a 换行符）将恶意命令直接传递至 shell 执行；另一方面，通过向 /cgi-auth/userreg.cgi 发送超长特制 POST 请求触发栈溢出，可覆盖返回地址并执行 shellcode。该漏洞影响部署 MailStudio 2000 2.0 的所有 Linux/Windows 服务器，成功利用后攻击者可读取系统敏感文件、窃取邮件与密码、修改或删除用户数据，并进一步控制整个服务器。由于攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低且无需任何授权，CVSS v2 基础评分满分 10.0，危害极其严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0527"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55.630","remediation":"立即将 MailStudio 2000 升级至厂商发布的安全修复版本，或迁移至受支持的后续版本。如暂时无法升级，应在 Web 服务器配置中删除或禁用 /cgi-auth/userreg.cgi 脚本，仅保留必要的 CGI 功能；同时修改该文件权限为不可执行（如 chmod 644），并在防火墙或 WAF 中拦截包含换行符（%0a、%0d）、管道符（|）、分号（;）等 shell 元字符的 HTTP 请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0081.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1335","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20007","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0527.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0527","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0527/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0527.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0527.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-93w2-mg33-r998/GHSA-93w2-mg33-r998.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1335/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d43a0fb8-e01e-4de0-9437-1c756d8c7617.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0438.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0438.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0438.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0437","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0437.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0526","title":"3R Soft MailStudio 2000 2.0 任意文件访问漏洞","description":"3R Soft MailStudio 2000 2.0 及更早版本的 mailview.cgi CGI 程序存在路径遍历漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过在参数中构造 \"..\" (点点) 路径遍历序列，绕过目录限制读取服务器文件系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 MailStudio 2000 2.0 及更早版本，CVSS 5.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N)，攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响机密性。攻击者可利用此漏洞读取敏感系统文件、配置文件或源代码，导致信息泄露。ExploitDB 已收录公开利用代码 (EDB-ID: 20008)。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0526"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55.467","remediation":"建议立即升级 3R Soft MailStudio 2000 至 2.0 之后的最新版本（如 2.01 或更高版本），或从 3R Soft 官网下载官方补丁补丁包（如 MS2000-PATCH-20000609.exe）并安装。若暂无法升级，请在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 重写规则拦截包含 ../ 或 ..\\\\ 的请求路径，或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面启用目录遍历防护规则拦截 ../ 遍历攻击，同时限制 mailview.cgi 只能访问 Web 根目录下的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0081.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1335","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20008","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0526.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0526","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0526.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0526.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-79hc-q675-w3mx/GHSA-79hc-q675-w3mx.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0526.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1335/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0437.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0437.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0437.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0423","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0423.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0506","title":"Linux 内核 Capabilities 权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.16 之前版本中的 \"capabilities\"（能力）机制存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置 capabilities（使用 setcap 等机制）阻止 setuid 程序正常降权，导致拒绝服务或获取提升后的特权，即 \"Linux kernel setuid/setcap vulnerability\"。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.2.x 系列、2.4.0-test1 及 SGI ProPack 1.2/1.3 等发行版，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重），向量 AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C，攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、完全影响机密性/完整性/可用性。本地攻击者利用该漏洞可绕过 setuid 程序的权限降低机制，实现权限提升或拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0506"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52.870","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.16 或更高版本（2.2.x 分支）或升级至 2.4.x 稳定版本。SGI ProPack 用户请升级至 1.4 或更高版本（内核 ≥ 2.2.16）。若无法立即升级内核，可作为临时缓解措施：1) 移除不需要的 setuid 程序；2) 使用 chmod 移除不必要的 setuid 位；3) 限制本地用户登录权限；4) 监控异常 setuid 进程行为。Sendmail 用户请升级至 8.11 以上版本并禁用不必要的 capabilities 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0062.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0063.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-037.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1322","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006090852340.3475-300000%40alfa.elzabsoft.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20000","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0506.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0506","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0506.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/3bd1bd6e15d7a361230990a418fdbc924d1d9ca2/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2000-0506.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0506.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-hp2c-p3rm-92wr/GHSA-hp2c-p3rm-92wr.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0506.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-267.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0423.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0423.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0423.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1198","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0525","title":"OpenSSH UseLogin 配置项命令执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 在启用 UseLogin 选项时未能正确放弃特权，导致本地用户可通过向 ssh 守护进程传递命令参数执行任意代码。该漏洞影响启用 UseLogin 选项的 OpenSSH 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重级别），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可导致完全的机密性、完整性和可用性破坏。攻击者仅需本地账户权限，通过向 ssh 守护进程传递恶意命令参数即可实现任意代码执行，获取系统最高权限。OpenSSH 官方已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或禁用 UseLogin 选项。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0525"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55.343","remediation":"建议立即升级 OpenSSH 至 2.3.0 或更高版本（该版本修复了 UseLogin 权限降低漏洞）。若无法立即升级，请在 sshd_config 中将 UseLogin 设置为 no 并重启 sshd 服务作为临时缓解措施；同时建议限制本地用户 SSH 登录权限，配置防火墙限制 SSH 端口仅允许信任 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0065.html","http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#uselogin","http://www.osvdb.org/341","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1334","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4646","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0525.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0525","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0525.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0525.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hrrj-9rqm-m5rx/GHSA-hrrj-9rqm-m5rx.json","https://github.com/djc/oxish/blob/bf64cf02d5e31a17e708d69e2e0f66422499f851/openssh-vulnerabilities.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssh_uselogin.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0525.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0641","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0641.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0554","title":"Lilikoi Ceilidh 2.60 目录路径泄露漏洞","description":"Ceilidh 系统存在路径翻译功能漏洞，攻击者可通过提交包含特殊参数的请求，利用隐藏表单字段 `translated_path` 实现未授权的目录路径信息泄露。该漏洞源于系统未能对用户输入路径进行有效验证和过滤，导致攻击者得以获取 Ceilidh 目录的真实系统路径。这一信息泄露可能为攻击者提供进一步实施目录遍历或系统攻破所需的信息。漏洞影响广泛，适用于所有安装 Ceilidh 的互联网服务器，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程利用这一漏洞，极大拓展了攻击者的信息收集范围，为后续攻击奠定了基础。攻击者仅需发送包含恶意路径信息的 HTTP 请求，即可触发系统返回敏感的目录路径信息。Microsoft 和相关安全团队已证实该漏洞真实存在，并建议用户升级到最新安全补丁以修复这一问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0554"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59.260","remediation":"建议立即停用 Lilikoi Ceilidh 2.60 并迁移至现代 Web 会议系统（如 BigBlueButton、Jitsi Meet）。若必须继续使用，请在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截包含 translated_path 参数的请求，并在应用层对 hidden 表单字段实施严格输入验证与路径规范化过滤，防止路径遍历泄露服务器真实路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0246.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1320","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0554.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0554","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0554.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0554.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8wr3-5grg-gmwh/GHSA-8wr3-5grg-gmwh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0554.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1320/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0554.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0641.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0641.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0565","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0565.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0502","title":"迈克菲 VirusScan 访问控制漏洞","description":"McAfee VirusScan 4.03 存在访问控制漏洞，程序在将警报文本文件发送至 Central Alert Server 之前未正确限制对该文件的访问权限。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞在文件发送前任意篡改警报内容，篡改或伪造病毒警报信息，干扰安全监控与告警机制。该漏洞影响 McAfee VirusScan 4.03 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可通过修改临时警报文件实现任意警报内容篡改，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分完整性影响），属低危本地权限提升/完整性破坏漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0502"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52.287","remediation":"建议立即升级 McAfee VirusScan 至 4.5.1 或更高版本（McAfee 已发布安全补丁修复此访问控制问题），或迁移至 McAfee Endpoint Security 10.x 及以上版本。升级前请在 McAfee ePolicy Orchestrator 控制台执行“强制更新”任务，确保所有客户端自动下载并应用补丁包。若暂时无法升级，可临时在受影响系统上将 %ProgramFiles%\\McAfee\\VirusScan\\Alerts 目录的 ACL 设置为仅 SYSTEM 和 Administrators 可写，普通用户仅保留读取权限，同时在 ePO 策略中禁用“允许本地用户修改警报文件”选项，并通过防火墙限制本地 8080 端口仅允许受信管理服务器 IP 访问，防止本地恶意篡改警报文件内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0038.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6287","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1326","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4641","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0502.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0502","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0502.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0502.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-88gq-r6mm-hr99/GHSA-88gq-r6mm-hr99.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0502.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--34ac6378-01a5-4669-b9e0-8f514fbce96d.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0502.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0565.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0560","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0560.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0499","title":"BEA WebLogic JSP源代码泄露漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic 3.1.8 至 4.5.1 默认配置存在大小写敏感性处理缺陷（CWE-178），远程未授权攻击者可通过请求大写 .JSP 扩展名的 URL（如 /page.JSP 而非 /page.jsp），绕过 JSP 编译引擎直接获取 JSP 源代码，导致敏感业务逻辑、数据库连接信息等核心代码泄露。该漏洞影响 WebLogic 3.1.8 至 4.5.1 所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）和用户交互（UI:N），仅影响机密性（C:H）。攻击者只需发送包含大写 .JSP 后缀的 HTTP GET 请求即可无损获取源代码，无需认证交互。BEA 已在后续版本修复该配置缺陷，建议升级至修复版本并配置 Web 服务器强制小写扩展名映射。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0499"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51.860","remediation":"建议立即升级 BEA WebLogic 至 4.5.2 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞）。无法升级时，在 WebLogic 管理控制台中禁用 JSP 大小写不敏感映射，或在 Web 服务器/防火墙层拦截所有包含大写 .JSP/.Jsp 等扩展名的请求，同时配置 Web 服务器拒绝直接访问 .jsp 源文件。建议同时部署 WAF 规则拦截包含大写 JSP 扩展名的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0262.htm","http://developer.bea.com/alerts/security_000612.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1328","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4694","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0499.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0499","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fbf5034ab66635f118016eef30012810a55b9a37/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0499.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0499.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qc48-8mcw-gxqv/GHSA-qc48-8mcw-gxqv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0499.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-178.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dd59df2a-0d14-435e-8cf1-d1fd2e93abdd.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0499.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0560.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0560.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0560.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0558","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0498","title":"Unify eWave ServletExec JSP源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Unify eWave ServletExec 存在大小写敏感性处理不当漏洞（CWE-178），远程攻击者可通过请求大写扩展名的 JSP URL（如 .JSP 而非 .jsp）绕过 Servlet 容器的源代码保护机制，直接获取 JSP 源代码。该漏洞影响使用 Unify eWave ServletExec 的 Web 应用服务器，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）和用户交互（UI:N），仅影响机密性（C:H）。攻击者无需认证即可通过简单的 HTTP GET 请求获取 JSP 源代码，可能导致敏感业务逻辑、数据库连接信息、密钥等敏感信息泄露。该漏洞源于 Servlet 容器对文件扩展名大小写处理不一致，导致 JSP 编译处理被绕过，直接返回源文件内容。建议升级到修复版本或配置 Web 服务器规范化 URL 大小写处理。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0498"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51.720","remediation":"建议立即升级 Unify eWave ServletExec 至官方修复版本（建议升级至 4.2 或更高版本）。配置 Web 服务器（如 Apache/IIS）强制规范化 URL 路径大小写，或在 Servlet 容器中配置大小写不敏感的 JSP 映射。部署 WAF 规则拦截包含大写 .JSP、.Jsp 等变体扩展名的请求。配置 Web 服务器禁止直接访问 .jsp 源文件（仅允许编译后的类访问）。部署 Web 应用防火墙监控异常源码访问请求，并记录审计日志用于事后溯源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0250.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1328","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4649","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0498.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0498","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6bd2f3671962f9ee453128567db1f722844715d5/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0498.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0498.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9cg4-m358-cc47/GHSA-9cg4-m358-cc47.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0498.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-178.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0498.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8ec7beff-3baf-45f4-a42a-13c8824de65f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0558.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0558.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0557","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0497","title":"IBM WebSphere server 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"IBM WebSphere Application Server 3.0.2 存在大小写处理不当的源代码泄露漏洞（CWE-178）。由于服务器在处理 JSP 文件请求时未正确区分文件扩展名的大小写，当攻击者使用大写的 .JSP 扩展名构造恶意 URL 发起请求时，服务器不会将请求转发给 JSP 引擎进行编译执行，而是直接将原始 JSP 源代码以纯文本形式返回给客户端。该漏洞影响运行在 IBM WebSphere 3.0.2 上的所有基于 JSP 的 Web 应用程序，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程利用。通过发送特制的包含大写扩展名的 URL，攻击者可获取 JSP 源文件内容，从而暴露应用程序中的数据库连接字符串、业务逻辑代码、硬编码凭证等敏感信息，进而为进一步攻击提供情报支持。该漏洞 CVSS v3.1 评分为 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需权限和用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0497"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51.583","remediation":"建议立即升级 IBM WebSphere Application Server 至 3.0.2.1 版本或更高版本，或应用 IBM 发布的修复补丁包。若暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置大小写不敏感的 JSP 扩展名映射，或在 Web 服务器/防火墙层面拦截大写 .JSP 后缀请求，防止 JSP 源代码泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0263.html","http://www-4.ibm.com/software/webservers/appserv/efix.html","http://www.securityfocu