务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备本地认证权限，利用难度较低，已有公开的 PoC 利用代码（MS00-040）。Microsoft 已发布安全公告并提供相应补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0377"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35.390","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-040 提供的热修复补丁 Q264684，下载地址为 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=292D70D6-9948-48AD-A3FE-435642D3A0A9。如无法安装补丁，可通过修改注册表 Winreg 键的 AllowedPaths 值，禁止所有已验证用户远程访问任何注册表项作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=264684","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1331","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-040","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1021","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20006","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0377.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0377","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0377.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0377.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/353cb430aaf7f69b16773a8574ce64453e800828/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x6w9-h4wh-qw7r/GHSA-x6w9-h4wh-qw7r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0377.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--80cc8c05-2ec8-4b07-8cbd-faa16e59f46c.json","https://github.com/Security-Onion-Solutions/securityonion-resources-playbooks/blob/f513ac5a899a3bfb4616a16cf75f602b9b6d7b0f/public/nids/individual/2103223.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0310.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0592","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0592.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0522","title":"RSA ACE Server 认证UDP数据包洪水拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RSA ACE Server 至 4.1 版本存在认证 UDP 数据包泛洪拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的认证服务发送大量特制 UDP 数据包，导致服务器资源耗尽，无法正常处理合法认证请求，造成服务中断。该漏洞影响 RSA ACE Server 4.1 及更早版本，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施攻击，无需特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0522"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08","updated":"2000-06-08","remediation":"立即升级 RSA ACE/Server 至 4.1 以上已修复版本，或从厂商 FTP 下载 dos/readme.txt 中提供的补丁程序安装。如无法升级，可在防火墙或网络边界限制对服务器认证端口（UDP 5500）的访问，仅允许可信客户端 IP 连接，以缓解 UDP 泛洪攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0522.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0522","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0522.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0522.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-whm3-4fg3-jfp7/GHSA-whm3-4fg3-jfp7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0522.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260a